# Sneak {B} (CR 702.190a) is cast "during your declare blockers step", returning "an unblocked creature you control". It is
# not offered in the main phase, and not in the declare blockers step when the only attacker was blocked by Bot2's
# Ornithopter; the positive control, a different scenario, is the sneak with an unblocked attacker.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Shredder's Technique
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Hand.Shredder's Technique.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Ability: Sneak)
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
! Bot1.Hand.Shredder's Technique.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Ability: Sneak)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Ornithopter
